---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Statutory Disclaimer & MahaRERA Compliance | Paranjape Blue Ridge Hinjewadi"
  description="Statutory real estate disclaimer, MahaRERA registration details, and channel partner disclosures for Paranjape Blue Ridge."
  pathname="/disclaimer"
>
  <main class="pt-28 pb-20 bg-[#FAF9F6] text-[#070D1A]">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <div class="mb-10 border-b border-slate-200 pb-6">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-xs font-mono text-[#785415] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-4">
          Statutory Real Estate Disclosure • MahaRERA
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A] tracking-tight mb-3">
          Disclaimer & RERA Notice
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-slate-500">
          In Accordance with MahaRERA Circulars & Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 space-y-8 font-sans leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        
        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-200/80 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#785415]">MahaRERA Project Registrations</h2>
          <p>
            Paranjape Blue Ridge is an integrated township project located at Phase 1, Rajiv Gandhi Infotech Park, Hinjewadi, Pune 411057, developed by Paranjape Schemes (Construction) Ltd. The ongoing enclaves are duly registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority (MahaRERA):
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
              <div class="font-bold text-[#070D1A] text-sm mb-1">Promenade Residences</div>
              <div class="text-[#785415] font-extrabold">MahaRERA: P52100055581</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
              <div class="font-bold text-[#070D1A] text-sm mb-1">The Altius</div>
              <div class="text-[#785415] font-extrabold">MahaRERA: P52100078116</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
              <div class="font-bold text-[#070D1A] text-sm mb-1">The Ridges 41</div>
              <div class="text-[#785415] font-extrabold">MahaRERA: P52100000054</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 pt-2">
            The project details, sanctions, and approvals are available on the MahaRERA portal under registered projects: <a href="https://maharera.maharerait.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#785415] underline font-bold">https://maharera.maharerait.gov.in</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">Channel Partner & Advisory Transparency</h2>
          <p>
            This portal (paranjapeblueridge.com) is operated by <strong>Propsmart Realty</strong>, an authorized real estate channel partner and advisory syndicate working in coordination with developers to provide booking guidance, inventory details, and customer consultation.
          </p>
          <p>
            This website does not constitute an official advertisement by the developer or an offer for sale under MahaRERA. The official promoter and developer of the township is <em>Paranjape Schemes (Construction) Ltd.</em> (PSCL).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">Renders & Architectural Visuals</h2>
          <p>
            Photographs, artistic impressions, 3D renderings, computer-generated walk-throughs, elevation models, and interior representations displayed across this portal are conceptual and for illustrative guidance only. Actual construction layout, fittings, specifications, dimensions, color palettes, and finishings may vary in accordance with structural engineering advisories and sanctioning approvals.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">Financial Projections & Indicative Returns</h2>
          <p>
            Calculated rental yields (4–5%) and historic capital appreciation rates mentioned in market insight articles are based on historical West Pune micro-market trends. They do not constitute guaranteed returns or legally binding investment assurances. Prospective purchasers are advised to conduct independent due diligence prior to executing binding purchase contracts.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a href="/" class="btn-champagne px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest no-underline inline-block shadow-sm">
          &larr; Return to Blue Ridge Home
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
